{
  "about": "GolfRecs driver catalog (2026-10-21): drivers from 17 brands, the current and previous generation of each line (women's builds, junior clubs, colourway editions, length variants and shaft-only listings left out). A driver is in the catalog when the maker's own site lists it, PGA TOUR Superstore lists it, or it has a review on Golfalot, Today's Golfer or Golf Monthly; a previous generation is included only when a linked page shows it is the line before the current one. Specs come from the linked pages, in this order: the maker's spec table, then the Today's Golfer, Golfalot or Golf Monthly spec box, then PGA TOUR Superstore's product text; a value no linked page states is left blank, and an adjustable hosel is marked No only when the page says the hosel is fixed. Lofts are the lofts the maker sells, stock shaft is the first stock option listed. Category follows the maker's own model naming or page wording (LS/LST/Triple Diamond = low spin, Max/K/10K = max forgiveness, D/SFT/Draw = draw, Lite/HL/Max Fast/lightweight = lightweight, Mini = mini driver) and is blank for core models. Columns: shape = category, weight = lofts, balance = head size, core = stock shaft, surface = adjustable hosel.",
